== Usage ==
<pre>{{Time ago|TIMESTAMP}}</pre>
This template displays how long ago a given timestamp occurred. It uses [[Module:TimeAgo]] to parse various date formats, including raw MediaWiki timestamps.

== Examples ==
<pre>
* {{Time ago|2024-01-01}}
* {{Time ago|{{#time:c|-2 hours}}}}
* {{Time ago|{{#time:c|+2 hours}}}}
* {{Time ago|{{#time:c|+2 years}}}}
* {{Time ago|2024-11-29T10:30:04}}
* {{Time ago|{{REVISIONTIMESTAMP}}}}
* {{Time ago|20241125134745}}
</pre>

'''Output:'''
* {{Time ago|2024-01-01}}
* {{Time ago|{{#time:c|-2 hours}}}}
* {{Time ago|{{#time:c|+2 hours}}}}
* {{Time ago|{{#time:c|+2 years}}}}
* {{Time ago|2024-11-29T10:30:04}}
* {{Time ago|{{REVISIONTIMESTAMP}}}}
* {{Time ago|20241125134745}}

